#! mathcas 2 notebook

#% title
# paul_wavelet

#% text
# `paul_wavelet(m)` is the Paul wavelet of order m (default 4): in frequency 2^m/sqrt(m (2m - 1)!) (s w)^m exp(-s w) for w > 0 and 0 for w < 0 (Torrence and Compo, 1998, table 1).

#% section
# Examples

#% subsection
# Basic examples

#% cell
x = n(table(exp(-(k - 32)^2/20), [k, 64]))

#% cell
norm(inverse_continuous_wavelet_transform(continuous_wavelet_transform(x, paul_wavelet(), [4, 4])) - x) < 1e-10
#% output
#= true

